Description: Spotlight-style tone-rewrite overlay (via Claude Code)
 friendly opens a centered text area you dictate or type into, lets you pick a
 tone (professional, kind, concise...), rewrites the message with Claude Code
 (claude -p), and copies the result to the clipboard. Built for a Wayland voice
 dictation workflow (wlroots / Sway).
 .
 The "claude" CLI (Claude Code) is required at runtime and is not packaged in
 Debian/Ubuntu; install it with: npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code
